summary:
  An episode a pause keeps is not held: Next and Previous from the desk go
  to the list of stations.

history:
  A headset's Next over an episode paused in place put a radio station on,
  because the branch asked whether the player was playing. An episode is
  held while it plays and while a pause keeps it, and the four commands
  that move a needle stay inside it.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TransportLogic.js

find:
      if (!plays && !keptEpisode && !(on && f.casting === true)) return "station";

replace:
      if (!plays && !(on && f.casting === true)) return "station";

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_transportlogic.qml::test_an_episode_a_pause_keeps_in_the_player_is_skipped_inside
  and tests/qml/tst_transportroads.qml::test_next_over_a_paused_episode_goes_on_inside_it_and_starts_no_station.
  Line-neutral.
